# Credentials
# The account layer never writes cookies to disk (only InMemoryBilibiliCookieStore
# is shipped), and every fixture uses de-sensitized placeholder values. These
# patterns are a guard in case an application points a custom BilibiliCookieStore
# at the repository, or a helper script stores a test cookie in a local env file.
*.cookies.json
*.cookie-store.json
bilibili_account_cookies.json
.bilibili-cookies*
cookies.txt
.env
.env.*
*.local.ps1
